    "body": "A few steps\r\n\r\n- [ ] Finalize /terms and /privacy content (Brian from legal)\r\n- [ ] Create a PR in https://github.com/mozilla/legal-docs adding docs (Cory/Wil/John)\r\n- [ ] ~~Update deployment to use legal repo (Engineering)**~~\r\n\r\n** So it turns out we _aren't_ automatically pulling things in from legal-docs in Test Pilot (still open https://github.com/mozilla/testpilot/issues/738). The agreement we made was that we'd have keep an up to date copy of the documents on legal-docs. I'll check to see if we can maintain this agreement for Screenshots (at least for launch)\r\n",
